  "created": "2026-10-29T10:31:53.11Z",
  "description": "AiTO CMS Translation Extension for Dynamicweb 10, developed by Mardi Gras, takes your language websites from export to finished translation and keeps track of what is translated.\n\t\t\tExport the translatable text of pages, paragraphs and item types (Swift 2, Swift 1 and custom, including slides, accordion items and button labels) to a file for your translator or translation tool, and import the translation directly back into the correct language website.\n\t\t\t<br /><br /><b>Export what needs translating</b> – the whole website or selected pages with their sub pages, as JSON or XLIFF 1.2 for CAT tools such as Trados, memoQ, Phrase and Smartcat. Export all texts or only untranslated, outdated or changed texts, SEO fields only or everything except them.\n\t\t\t<br /><br /><b>Import safely</b> – preview every import, keep texts changed in the CMS after the export, and undo an import from the import history. Only text is written; layout and design settings are never touched.\n\t\t\t<br /><br /><b>Know your translation status</b> – an overview with charts per language website, and status per site, page and field: translated, partly translated, outdated (the source changed after translation) or not translated. Edit a text directly or mark texts as translated when they are the same in both languages.\n\t\t\t<br /><br /><b>Manage files</b> – download, upload and delete export and import files directly in the backoffice.\n\t\t\t<br /><br />\n\t\t\tFully compatible with both Dynamicweb SaaS Cloud and On-Premise environments. Requires Dynamicweb 10.27.10 or higher and a license key from Mardi Gras.\n\t\t\t<br /><br />\n\t\t\tRead more and get started: <a href=\"https://mardigras.se/aito\" target=\"_blank\">https://mardigras.se/aito</a><br /><br />\n\t\t\tFor support or inquiries, contact Mardi Gras at <a href=\"mailto:support@mardigras.se\">support@mardigras.se</a>",
