  "releaseNotes": "1.3.2: Fixes \"The view ... was not found\" on sites that installed the app from the App Store; security update of System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs. 1.3.1: Updated app description. 1.3.0: Export only untranslated, outdated or changed texts, sub pages, SEO fields; translation status in the page selector; links in XLIFF imports point to the language website's pages. See README for all changes.",
